# Freshness Log — {{domain}}

Tracks the freshness status of each learning module.

## Freshness Risk Legend

- 🟢 **Stable**: Foundational knowledge, unlikely to change (review every 12+ months)
- 🟡 **Evolving**: Changes every 1–3 years (review every 3–6 months)
- 🔴 **Volatile**: Changes frequently (review every 1–4 weeks)

